## What NOT to do (project prohibitions)

- **Emptiness that is CORRECT is not "unfilled".** Do not invent a field absent from the source
  and do not substitute something plausible: empty stays empty and is labelled in words on screen. Each
  measured case would have cost the customer a falsehood — a substitution would attribute to the author a claim they
  did not make; an unparsed date would go out as the decision date; "0 of 0" would read as under-filling
  where there is nothing to enrich. A stub in the DATA is forbidden, an honest caption on the SCREEN is mandatory.
